# ERP System Login Credentials

**⚠️ Copy this file to CREDENTIALS.md and fill in your actual credentials.**
**CREDENTIALS.md is gitignored and will not be committed.**

---

## Superadmin Login

```
Email:    superadmin@voltcore.com
Password: [CHANGE_AFTER_FIRST_LOGIN]
Access:   Full system access, manage all tenants
URL:      /superadmin
```

---

## Production Database Credentials

```
PostgreSQL User:     erp_user
PostgreSQL Password: [YOUR_SECURE_PASSWORD]
Host:                localhost
Port:                5432

Databases:
- erp (main tenant)
- erp_demo (demo tenant)  
- erp_superadmin (superadmin database)
```

---

## VPS SSH Access

```
SSH User: erp
SSH Host: [YOUR_VPS_IP]
SSH Port: 22
SSH Key:  [PATH_TO_YOUR_SSH_KEY]
```

---

## Tenant Admin Accounts

### Tenant: [COMPANY_NAME]
```
Email:    [admin@company.com]
Password: [SECURE_PASSWORD]
Access:   [all modules / specific modules]
```

---

## Security Checklist

- [ ] Changed superadmin password from default
- [ ] Using strong passwords (16+ chars, mixed case, numbers, symbols)
- [ ] PostgreSQL password is not the default
- [ ] SSH key-based authentication enabled
- [ ] Firewall configured (only ports 22, 80, 443 open)
- [ ] Regular database backups scheduled
- [ ] This file (CREDENTIALS.md) is NOT committed to git
